\section{Global Stress Testing and Results}

Mnemosyne was subjected to multi-scale adversarial perturbations:

\subsection{Vector 1: Aggregation Surge}

A 400\% increase in nucleation rate tested proteostatic invariants.  
The engine restored negative aggregate velocity within 9 ticks.

\subsection{Vector 2: Metabolic Collapse}

ATP production was suppressed by 70\%.  
Layer C stabilized mitochondrial flux and restored metabolic invariants.

\subsection{Vector 3: Synaptic Noise Injection}

High-frequency noise was injected into synaptic channels.  
Network fidelity remained above the eradication threshold.

\subsection{Global Result}

Across all perturbations:
\begin{equation}
  \mathcal{R}_{\text{eradication}} = 1,
\end{equation}
and Lyapunov stability was maintained:
\begin{equation}
  \frac{dV_{\text{Mnemosyne}}}{dt} < 0.
\end{equation}